# Layers 2, 4 and 7c together (CR 613.1b, 613.1d, 613.4c). Opalescence makes Bot2's Glorious Anthem a 3/3 creature (layer 4,
# base power and toughness its mana value in 7b), so Bot1's Mind Control can enchant it. "Creatures you control get +1/+1"
# means the Anthem's controller (CR 109.5), which layer 2 settles first: before Mind Control, Bot2's Llanowar Elves is 2/2
# and the Anthem pumps itself to 4/4; once Bot1 controls it, Bot1's Ornithopter is 1/3, the Anthem still 4/4 (now Bot1's
# creature), and the Elves back to 1/1.

